TI  - Capitalizing on the Potential of South African Indigenous Beef Cattle Breeds: A Review
AU  - Este Van Marle-Köster
AU  - Carina Visser
AU  - Judith Sealy
AU  - Laurent Frantz
KW  - cattle ; adaptation ; ecotype ; genomic ; production traits ; Environmental effects of industries and plants ; TD194-195 ; Renewable energy sources ; TJ807-830 ; Environmental sciences ; GE1-350
